sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor P as Programmer
    participant UI as Track Controller UI (QML)
    participant S as TrackControllerState
    participant C as plc compiler
    participant W as TrackController (wayside)
    participant V as attached vital code
    P->>UI: click Run
    UI->>S: run()
    alt no track loaded
        S-->>UI: terminal: load a track first
    else a wayside is selected
        S->>C: compile_program(buffer)
        C-->>S: Program, diagnostics
        S->>W: diagnose(program)
        Note right of W: Names must be this wayside's I/O, every output driven.
        W-->>S: diagnostics
        alt any error
            S-->>UI: parser pane, compile failed, nothing sent
        else compiles
            S->>W: run_program(program, inputs.copy())
            W->>W: OS decode: inputs to bits
            W->>W: scan the program
            W->>V: scan(inputs + program outputs)
            V-->>W: final OUT_ bits
            W->>W: OS encode, overrides for display
            W-->>S: ScanReport (outputs, warnings, log)
            S->>S: verified := buffer, only if no diagnostic
            S-->>UI: sandbox outputs, log, overrides
            UI-->>P: Commit enabled only after a clean run
        end
    end
    Note over S,V: A sandbox: a copy of the wayside's inputs. The live outputs and the track are untouched.
